    "lineage": {
      "statement": "The CLC5 data (minimum mapping unit 5 hectares) are derived from the land cover model for Germany (LBM-DE) by generalization. This dataset, in which the minimum mapping is 1 hectare, contains land cover and land use information for each object. By means of a cross-table the single combinations of land cover and land use attributes are transformed - with regard to the degrees of sealing and vegetation that are stored in LBM-DE as well - into unique CLC codes."
    },
